==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* {{adv|Green}} and {{adv|Silver}}'s escape from [[Masked Man]]'s lair two years before the {{MangaArc|Red, Green & Blue|first chapter}} is shown. {{tt|*|VIZ release only}}
* {{adv|Red}} and {{adv|Blue}} return to [[Pallet Town]] and are attacked by an {{adv|Deoxys|invisible Pokémon}}. {{tt|*|VIZ release only}}
* Red and Blue leave their [[Pokédex]]es at {{adv|Professor Oak}}'s [[Professor Oak's Laboratory|laboratory]] and leave for [[Vermilion City]].
* Green is about to meet her parents, but the two are snagged by a mysterious shadow. She falls unconscious.
* [[Ultima]] appears and takes Red and Blue to the [[Sevii Islands]].
* Red's [[Saur]] and Blue's [[Blue's Charizard|Charizard]] learn {{m|Frenzy Plant}} and {{m|Blast Burn}}, respectively.
* [[Lorelei]] reappears.
* [[Sird]], [[Carr]], and [[Orm]] appear.
* The Three Beasts defame the [[Pokédex holder]]s and start wreaking havoc on the Five, Six, and Seven Islands. 
* It is revealed that Professor Oak has been kidnapped.
* Red begins to battle Deoxys.

